<div n="5"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">B.</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Die Regel</hi>.</hi></head><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <p>Die Regel hat</p><lb/>
